---
// Social proof — the research behind social commitment
---

<section class="social-proof section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Why it works</span>
      <h2>Accountability is the missing ingredient</h2>
      <p>The research behind why social commitment outperforms willpower alone.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="stats-grid reveal">
      <div class="stat-card">
        <span class="stat-number" data-count="65" data-suffix="%">65%</span>
        <p class="stat-label">more likely to reach your goal when you commit to a partner</p>
        <span class="stat-source">American Society of Training &amp; Development</span>
      </div>

      <div class="stat-card">
        <span class="stat-number" data-count="21">21</span>
        <p class="stat-label">days is the average time to form a new lasting habit</p>
        <span class="stat-source">Behavioral science research</span>
      </div>

      <div class="stat-card">
        <span class="stat-number" data-count="2">2</span>
        <p class="stat-label">people share one streak, and it only grows on days you both check in</p>
        <span class="stat-source">Built into TinyAct</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="proof-callout reveal">
      When your partner's streak <strong>depends on you showing up</strong>,
      motivation stops being optional.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .stats-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-6);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
  }

  .stat-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-8);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .stat-number {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-5xl);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--coral-deep);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 500;
    flex: 1;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .stat-source {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top: var(--space-3);
  }

  .proof-callout {
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 2vw, 1.375rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .proof-callout strong {
    color: var(--coral-deep);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .stats-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      max-width: 420px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }
  }
</style>
